1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,210
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">Agent 干活不是一问一答</font>

2
00:00:02,350 --> 00:00:04,990
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">读文件、改代码、跑测试</font>

3
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:07,410
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">每一步都带着全部上下文</font>

4
00:00:07,770 --> 00:00:09,770
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">模型要为每个 token</font>

5
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:10,540
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">存一对 K、V</font>

6
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:13,750
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">层数乘上长度，缓存越滚越大</font>

7
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:16,400
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">同一段上下文反复调用</font>

8
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:19,150
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">计算能省，显存却一直占着</font>

9
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:22,810
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">所以成本的大头，常常不是算力</font>

10
00:00:22,810 --> 00:00:25,130
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">而是装 KV cache 的显存</font>

11
00:00:25,490 --> 00:00:28,090
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">V4.1 Flash 把缓存压到</font>

12
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:29,640
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">上一代的四分之一</font>

13
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:31,310
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">一张卡，四倍会话</font>

14
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:34,690
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">硬盘上的前缀缓存只剩八分之一</font>

15
00:00:34,690 --> 00:00:36,920
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">八倍历史，冷启动也更快</font>

16
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:39,010
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">省下的是规模</font>

17
00:00:39,010 --> 00:00:42,020
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">更长记忆、更多并发、更低成本</font>

18
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:44,900
<font face="Microsoft YaHei" size="46" color="#e8eff2">缓存成了能力的地基</font>

